    "alpaca": {
      "note": "Alpaca Market Data, free Basic plan: real-time from the IEX exchange only (about 2.5% of US volume, not the consolidated tape); personal, non-commercial use, no redistribution (Alpaca Terms and Conditions, Customer Agreement s.30). Market data host only: the app never calls Alpaca trading endpoints. A Paper Only account is entitled to IEX data only, so feed=iex always.",
