        "session_close": "{state} (IEX regular-session close {as_of})",
        "session_close_open": "IEX regular-session close {as_of} (no regular-session IEX trade yet today)",
        "extended_hours": "IEX extended-hours trade {as_of} (outside the regular session; not a close)",
        "note": "A trade outside the regular session (premarket or after hours) never uses realtime or last_close: it gives way to the IEX regular-session close of the snapshot's closed daily bar (session_close, or session_close_open while the market is open), or is labelled extended_hours when no such bar is available."
